  "reasoning": "The defendants secretly stole crude oil from a pipeline, using a stolen vehicle and an underground tank, which constitutes theft (盗窃). While transferring the oil, a fire broke out that destroyed the vehicle, transformer and electrical equipment. The fire was not set intentionally but resulted from the dangerous method of handling and heating the oil, fitting the charge for negligent dangerous conduct that endangers public safety (过失以危险方法危害公共安全).",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]盗窃;过失以危险方法危害公共安全<eoa>"
